nment scientists  claims but there are a lot of people  that do not like the job he did  i don't know him i never met him i don't  want to meet him  but i watched him and he looks like an  angry disgruntled employee  who frankly according to some people  didn't do a very good job  i now uh ask for a moment of silence in  honor  of the over 80 000 americans who have  lost their lives  from covet 19. coronavirus still has  america in its grip what this testimony  showed perhaps  most plainly is just how politicized  it has become amanda walker sky news  washington
 

